<title>UK: GKN profits rise to 362.8 mln before excepts.</title>
<headline>GKN profits rise to 362.8 mln before excepts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31.</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		65.0		   vs 53.9</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 26.5		   vs 24.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     362.8		  vs 322.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   3.326 bln	    vs 3.014 bln</p>
<p>Full company name - GKN Plc</p>
<p>NOTE-The results above exclude a small exceptional gain which if included raises profits to 363.1 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
